cff-version: 1.2.0
title: vulnerable-nodejs
message: >-
  Vulnerable Nodejs — a real shop (NodeBazaar) intentionally full of
  security bugs. 14 labs, OWASP Top 10:2025, SAST benchmark.
  Node.js port of DVWA.
authors:
