  - nodejs
  - owasp
  - penetration-testing
  - security-training
abstract: >-
  An intentionally vulnerable Node.js/Express e-commerce application
  backed by real PostgreSQL and MongoDB. Ships with exploit guides,
  fix references, and a SAST benchmark, for security training and
  research on source code analyzers.